# craigtrim/axiom#76: the full synonym competes with a separate shorter class.
@prefix : <https://example.org/comma#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

:CultureAndMediaStudies a owl:Class;
    rdfs:label "Culture and Media Studies";
    rdfs:subClassOf :Media_Studies;
    rdfs:seeAlso "Culture, Media Studies" .
:Media_Studies a owl:Class; rdfs:label "Media Studies" .
